* KOGUMA MK4 noise study - circuit blocks built from the schematic
* (docs/calc/noise/lib/blocks.lib). Requires lib/models.lib.

**********************************************************************
* One wall-sensor channel + its supply filter + the ADC reference.
* Pins:
*   v33  : +3V3 rail (DC-DC U1 output)
*   gs   : signal ground at the sensor (PD anode, U74 V-, R79/C80, C78..C85)
*   gm   : ground at the MCU (VSSA, C51/C52)
*   out  : TIA output (WALL_x) as seen at the ADC pin
*   vdda : MCU VDDA = ADC reference (VFQFPN68: VREF+ = VDDA)
* params: iph = DC photocurrent, cf = feedback capacitance, lfb = bead L
*         rs2 = R80 (2.2 ohm in series with FB2), rv = R51 (2.2 ohm in series
*         with FB1), c51 = effective C51 (VDDA)
* Defaults = schematic of 2026-11-06 (commit a30ca35):
*   R80 2.2, R51 2.2, C51 4.7u 10V 0603 -> 2.4u effective at 3.3 V
* The 2026-11-01 schematic is rs2=1u rv=1u c51=0.8u (no R80/R51, C51 1u).
* Netlist refs: FB2, R80, C85, C78, C79, C83, C84, R78, R79, C80, U74A, R74,
*               C74, D74, R51, FB1, C51, C52
**********************************************************************
.subckt SENSORBLK v33 gs gm out vdda params: iph=1u cf=0.5p lfb=0.8u rs2=2.2 rv=2.2 c51=2.4u
Rs2  v33 v33f {rs2}
XFB2 v33f v3a BLM18PG221 Lf={lfb}
XC85 v3a gs MLCC C=5u esr=5m esl=0.6n
XC78 v3a gs MLCC C=5u esr=5m esl=0.6n
XC79 v3a gs MLCC C=5u esr=5m esl=0.6n
XC83 v3a gs MLCC C=100n esr=20m esl=0.5n
XC84 v3a gs MLCC C=100n esr=20m esl=0.5n
Iqo  v3a gs DC 14.7m
R78  v3a pdb 1k
R79  pdb gs 47
XC80 pdb gs MLCC C=10u esr=5m esl=0.6n
XU   pdb inn out v3a gs OPA2354B
R74  inn out 820k
C74  inn out {cf}
Cpcb inn gs 1p
XPD  gs inn SFH229FA Cj=11.5p
Iph  inn gs DC {iph}
* ADC reference
Rv   v33 v33v {rv}
XFB1 v33v vdda BLM18PG221 Lf={lfb}
XC51 vdda gm MLCC C={c51} esr=10m esl=0.5n
XC52 vdda gm MLCC C=100n esr=20m esl=0.5n
Iadc vdda gm DC 2m
.ends SENSORBLK
